{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/972828-talisman-v-periapt","id":972828,"title":"Talisman v Periapt","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-19T17:05:26-07:00","id":972828,"title":"Talisman v Periapt","content":"Okay... I know that the book that covers this in detail is forthcoming... But I have a quick question:<br /> <br /> If I understand things correctly, a Periapt is a wonder that holds 5xWonderDots in Quintessence.<br /> <br /> A Talisman, for the same dots (I believe) holds the same amount, but will also have an Arete equal to Wonderdots and a couple of cool effects. Aside from difficulty in creating a Talisman vs a Periapt, So why would anyone ever &quot;buy&quot; a Periapt for a character? I must be missing something. <br /> <br /> I'm currently trying to cobble together house rules for all the types of wonders my players are starting to get interested in making in the coming months...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12296-gabryl","name":"Gabryl","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T17:22:25-07:00","id":972833,"title":"","content":"My understanding is really out of date since I go with Revised for this stuff. But as far as I'm aware, Talismans don't intrinsically have Periapt components within them, that stuff costs extra.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/959615-chronicle-report-keepers-of-the-wyck\" target=\"_blank\">Keepers of the Wyck: A Chronicle I'm running</a> FINALE: Chapter 39: Green Fairy","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12193-saikou","name":"Saikou","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12193_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T03:13:27-07:00","id":976441,"title":"","content":"The primary difference has always been the difficulty of making. Talismans are far more than periapts, and just happen to sometimes have the same functionality of a periapt.<br /> They're far more complicated to make and they can be used for more things, for good and ill.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}